  <entry>
    <title>codex配置API</title>
    <link href="/blog/posts/codex%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AEAPI/"/>
    <url>/blog/posts/codex%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AEAPI/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="codex-cli安装"><a href="#codex-cli安装" class="headerlink" title="codex-cli安装"></a>codex-cli安装</h1><h2 id="环境安装"><a href="#环境安装" class="headerlink" title="环境安装"></a>环境安装</h2><p><a href="https://nodejs.org/en/download">最新node+npm环境</a></p><figure class="highlight awk"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs awk"><span class="hljs-comment"># Download and install nvm:</span><br>curl -o- https:<span class="hljs-regexp">//</span>raw.githubusercontent.com<span class="hljs-regexp">/nvm-sh/</span>nvm<span class="hljs-regexp">/v0.40.6/i</span>nstall.sh | bash<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># in lieu of restarting the shell</span><br>\. <span class="hljs-string">&quot;$HOME/.nvm/nvm.sh&quot;</span><br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># Download and install Node.js:</span><br>nvm install <span class="hljs-number">24</span><br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># Verify the Node.js version:</span><br>node -v <br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># Verify npm version:</span><br>npm -v <br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="codex-cli下载"><a href="#codex-cli下载" class="headerlink" title="codex-cli下载"></a>codex-cli下载</h2><blockquote><p>需要科学上网，这里可以使用ssh反向代理</p></blockquote><figure class="highlight coffeescript"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs coffeescript"><span class="hljs-built_in">npm</span> install -g @openai/codex<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h1 id="配置API"><a href="#配置API" class="headerlink" title="配置API"></a>配置API</h1><blockquote><p>由于codex-cli本身使用其他API配置比较麻烦，在headless服务器中使用cc-switch配置又不现实。所以这里使用cc-switch-cli</p></blockquote><h2 id="cc-switch-cli-下载"><a href="#cc-switch-cli-下载" class="headerlink" title="cc-switch-cli 下载"></a>cc-switch-cli 下载</h2><p><a href="https://github.com/saladday/cc-switch-cli">cc-switch-cli Github</a></p><blockquote><p>需要科学上网，使用ssh反向代理</p></blockquote><figure class="highlight vim"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs vim">curl -fsSL https://github.<span class="hljs-keyword">com</span>/SaladDay/<span class="hljs-keyword">cc</span>-switch-cli/releases/latest/download/install.<span class="hljs-keyword">sh</span> | bash<br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">cc</span>-switch completions install --activate<br><span class="hljs-keyword">source</span> ~/.bashrc<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="配置DeepSeek-API"><a href="#配置DeepSeek-API" class="headerlink" title="配置DeepSeek API"></a>配置DeepSeek API</h2><ol><li>使用<code>cc-switch</code>打开配置界面</li><li>使用<code>]</code>切换为codex配置</li><li>左侧进入 <strong>Providers</strong> 界面</li><li>右侧选择<code>a</code> 添加配置,并选择<strong>DeepSeek</strong>配置添加</li><li>填入<strong>API key</strong>, 保存退出</li><li>使用<code>[Space]</code> 选用DeepSeek配置</li><li>按<code>[Esc]</code>后，点击<code>P</code>开启路由功能，现在就可以正常使用了</li></ol><blockquote><p>接下来正常使用的时候记得把之前设置的反向代理给取消掉</p></blockquote><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">unset</span> http_proxy<br><span class="hljs-built_in">unset</span> https_proxy<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
    
    
    
