  <entry>
    <title>vscode server国内源更换</title>
    <link href="/blog/posts/vscode-server%E5%9B%BD%E5%86%85%E6%BA%90%E6%9B%B4%E6%8D%A2/"/>
    <url>/blog/posts/vscode-server%E5%9B%BD%E5%86%85%E6%BA%90%E6%9B%B4%E6%8D%A2/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="添加vscode-server国内wget源"><a href="#添加vscode-server国内wget源" class="headerlink" title="添加vscode server国内wget源"></a>添加vscode server国内wget源</h1><blockquote><p>需要sudo权限</p></blockquote><p><strong>永久方案，且为所有用户设置</strong></p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">tee</span> /usr/local/bin/wget &lt;&lt; <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;EOF&#x27;</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">#!/bin/bash</span><br>a=(); <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> x <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;<span class="hljs-variable">$@</span>&quot;</span>; <span class="hljs-keyword">do</span> a+=(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;<span class="hljs-variable">$&#123;x//update.code.visualstudio.com/vscode.cdn.azure.cn&#125;</span>&quot;</span>); <span class="hljs-keyword">done</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">exec</span> /usr/bin/wget <span class="hljs-string">&quot;<span class="hljs-variable">$&#123;a[@]&#125;</span>&quot;</span><br>EOF<br><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">chmod</span> +x /usr/local/bin/wget<br><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">tee</span> /usr/local/bin/curl &lt;&lt; <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;EOF&#x27;</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">#!/bin/bash</span><br>a=(); <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> x <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;<span class="hljs-variable">$@</span>&quot;</span>; <span class="hljs-keyword">do</span> a+=(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;<span class="hljs-variable">$&#123;x//update.code.visualstudio.com/vscode.cdn.azure.cn&#125;</span>&quot;</span>); <span class="hljs-keyword">done</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">exec</span> /usr/bin/curl <span class="hljs-string">&quot;<span class="hljs-variable">$&#123;a[@]&#125;</span>&quot;</span><br>EOF<br><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">chmod</span> +x /usr/local/bin/curl<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h1 id="取消设置"><a href="#取消设置" class="headerlink" title="取消设置"></a>取消设置</h1><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">rm</span> /usr/local/bin/&#123;wget,curl&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
    
    
    
    <tags>
      
      <tag>vscode</tag>
      
    </tags>
    
  </entry>
  
  
  
