    <title>SSH Guard</title>
    <link href="/blog/posts/SSH-Guard/"/>
    <url>/blog/posts/SSH-Guard/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>先行尝试终端ssh连接，再尝试vscode等应用远程连接。</p><h1 id="host-key过期"><a href="#host-key过期" class="headerlink" title="host key过期"></a>host key过期</h1><p>如果出现类似下面的报错信息：</p><figure class="highlight gauss"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs gauss"><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">@</span>    WARNING: REMOTE HOST IDENTIFICATION HAS CHANGED!     <span class="hljs-comment">@</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><span class="hljs-comment">@@</span><br>.....<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>linux系统上需运行(<strong>替换用户家目录</strong>)：</p><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs powershell">ssh<span class="hljs-literal">-keygen</span> <span class="hljs-operator">-f</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;/home/userName/.ssh/known_hosts&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-literal">-R</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;[xxx.xxx.xxx.xxx]:1022&quot;</span><br>ssh<span class="hljs-literal">-keygen</span> <span class="hljs-operator">-f</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;/home/userName/.ssh/known_hosts&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-literal">-R</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;[xxx.xxx.xxx.xxx]:2022&quot;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>window系统上需运行：</p><figure class="highlight nix"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs nix">ssh-keygen <span class="hljs-operator">-</span>f <span class="hljs-string">&quot;$env:USERPROFILE<span class="hljs-char escape_">\.</span>ssh<span class="hljs-char escape_">\k</span>nown_hosts&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-operator">-</span>R <span class="hljs-string">&quot;[xxx.xxx.xxx.xxx]:1022&quot;</span><br>ssh-keygen <span class="hljs-operator">-</span>f <span class="hljs-string">&quot;$env:USERPROFILE<span class="hljs-char escape_">\.</span>ssh<span class="hljs-char escape_">\k</span>nown_hosts&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-operator">-</span>R <span class="hljs-string">&quot;[xxx.xxx.xxx.xxx]:2022&quot;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h1 id="SCP-传输文件加速"><a href="#SCP-传输文件加速" class="headerlink" title="SCP 传输文件加速"></a>SCP 传输文件加速</h1><p>使用以下传输命令（将用户名和路径进行替换）</p><figure class="highlight nginx"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs nginx"><span class="hljs-comment"># 2022服务器传输</span><br><span class="hljs-attribute">scp</span> -o <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;ProxyJump userName<span class="hljs-variable">@xxx</span>.xxx.xxx.xxx:2022&#x27;</span> \<br>    <span class="hljs-string">&quot;D:/bigfile.tar&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;userName@10.199.161.176:/path/&quot;</span><br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 1022服务器传输</span><br>scp -o <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;ProxyJump userName<span class="hljs-variable">@xxx</span>.xxx.xxx.xxx:1022&#x27;</span> \<br>    <span class="hljs-string">&quot;D:/bigfile.tar&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;userName@10.199.161.166:/path/&quot;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h1 id="vscode加速"><a href="#vscode加速" class="headerlink" title="vscode加速"></a>vscode加速</h1><p>将vscode的配置进行修改</p><h2 id="对于2022服务器配置"><a href="#对于2022服务器配置" class="headerlink" title="对于2022服务器配置"></a>对于2022服务器配置</h2><figure class="highlight crmsh"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs crmsh">Host <span class="hljs-number">2022</span>服务器校外<br>  HostName xxx.xxx.xxx.xxx<br>  Port <span class="hljs-number">2022</span><br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">User</span> <span class="hljs-title">userName</span><br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 修改为如下形式:</span><br><br>Host <span class="hljs-number">2022</span>服务器校外<br>  HostName <span class="hljs-number">10.199</span>.<span class="hljs-number">161.176</span><br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">User</span> <span class="hljs-title">userName</span><br>  ProxyJump userName@xxx.xxx.xxx.xxx:<span class="hljs-number">2022</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="对于1022服务器配置"><a href="#对于1022服务器配置" class="headerlink" title="对于1022服务器配置"></a>对于1022服务器配置</h2><figure class="highlight crmsh"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs crmsh">Host <span class="hljs-number">1022</span>服务器校外<br>  HostName xxx.xxx.xxx.xxx<br>  Port <span class="hljs-number">1022</span><br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">User</span> <span class="hljs-title">userName</span><br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 修改为如下形式:</span><br><br>Host <span class="hljs-number">1022</span>服务器校外<br>  HostName <span class="hljs-number">10.199</span>.<span class="hljs-number">161.166</span><br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">User</span> <span class="hljs-title">userName</span><br>  ProxyJump userName@xxx.xxx.xxx.xxx:<span class="hljs-number">1022</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
    
    
    
    <tags>
      
      <tag>ssh_guard</tag>
      
      <tag>vscode_accelerate</tag>
      
    </tags>
    
